{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1791.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"1639cea7a529e4a76240ee9ef26b30aad99db6095c3cea3ead2f696d3b62946c","ja":"最後まで駆け抜けて！","zh":"一路冲到最后！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1791.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"3625702749cb78b6f004e0f0608da9253609b88513c7f032b1f338017c30c29f","ja":"一方、志保と歌織とひなたは\n番組で街頭インタビューをしていて……","zh":"另一方面，志保、歌织和日向正在节目中进行街头采访……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1791.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"dee5656f36bcb7ca3e7a5f89452734954ad1670211ab52e8135bb5251d3fc948","ja":"今ね、夏期講習に通う受験生のみんなに\n話を聞いてるんだぁ。","zh":"我现在正在采访来上暑期补习班的考生们呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1791.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"76d6c5e3913d4fa3301c419448c10cde458f8e42576961c6d65d46082b42e0c8","ja":"暑い中、お疲れさまです。さっそくですが、\n一日のスケジュールを教えてもらえませんか？","zh":"天气这么热，辛苦了。冒昧问一下，可以告诉我一天的日程安排吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1791.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"80a7fd5472d77920fd04f56aaa04b0032da5b31006d0d0d46f936e4a04a65f13","ja":"「ええと、こんな感じですね～。講習前後も\n塾の学習室に入れるから、自習してて……」","zh":"呃，大概就是这样吧～。因为讲习前后也能进补习班的自习室，所以可以自己学习……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1791.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"14bd8560068a16952d576e560246a2d2efca7f4fb17eab1492cef5f73ef88df4","ja":"すごい……！\nとっても頑張ってるのね！","zh":"好厉害……！\n你真的很努力呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1791.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"95991f512a99a4cfb4cdb959c666e6f8e30a21de8d9663a803f39237a5ed9e0a","ja":"「えへへ。あ、でもみなさんも忙しいですよね」\n「ずっと頑張れる秘訣とかって、あるんですか？」","zh":"“嘿嘿。不过，大家也都很忙吧。”\n“有什么能让自己一直努力下去的秘诀吗？”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1791.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"0770809134c3b117d845be186578f50e7b6d4b8b075d685e7798f4780c88c4dc","ja":"そうだねぇ……みんなが頑張ってるから、\nあたしも頑張らねばって思うよぉ。","zh":"是啊……因为大家都在努力，  \n我也觉得自己得加油才行呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1791.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"aea57d8a9c4f97e730007cf0a58081d78634617d9c5e3190b426b19fae61ddde","ja":"今も、他の場所で、私たちの仲間が\n頑張ってるの。だから、私も負けてられないなって。","zh":"现在，我们的同伴也在其他地方努力着。所以，我也不能输给他们。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1791.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"327a36cf9a9b611d51a09b8e5b4cfc26f8ba5cc9b523722d46d692e12739f26b","ja":"そうですね。周りのみんなから、\nいい影響をもらってると思います。","zh":"是啊。我觉得自己从身边的大家那里，受到了很好的影响。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1791.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"05f83b69943e28ca75fa8328109ac5a602f88988cbb697c51d1c45a5a7271ddc","ja":"そしてみんなは、劇場で合流して……","zh":"然后大家在剧场汇合……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1791.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"9e01f572153d4402c02289e259cc6db8dd88142d758278fa72960e8678ba2f42","ja":"インタビュー、うまくできたんだね！\nテレビで見るのが楽しみ～♪","zh":"采访进行得很顺利呢！\n好期待在电视上看到～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1791.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"8ae389ca5224859519089e0ab4f27a506b2054c9b60c167c22a58961a406caaa","ja":"えへへ。あたしたちも元気をもらえたんだ。\n番組に出られて、なまらよかったよぉ♪","zh":"嘿嘿。我们也从中获得了活力。能参加节目，真是太好了♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1791.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"46502027067faa8378fa8dbc786a564fd8a0bccad47be698d807cb3385643c97","ja":"未来ちゃんたちのトークイベントも、\nとっても盛り上がったんだってね。","zh":"听说未来她们的脱口秀活动也进行得非常热烈呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1791.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"b402e5ef7b1275afa76a7fbff3938f5db11cbc751165abc8d8a2e4e21556d93e","ja":"はい！　もう少しで遅れるところでしたけど、\nすっごく楽しかったです！","zh":"是的！差点就要迟到了，不过特别开心！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1791.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"8bb0eed1cb3d253914f3059f8f6e9843588e19d13e75ca9004500b85e4f0e47b","ja":"なんだか、みんなと一緒なら、これからも、\nなんでもできちゃう気がするな～♪","zh":"总觉得，只要和大家在一起，今后也一定什么都能做到呢～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1791.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"aef1305484366556c46d117e565fe5b65722776035b1de8706c6b15fe6afb039","ja":"安心するのは早いわよ\nまだ、劇場公演が残ってるんだから。","zh":"现在安心还早了\n毕竟剧场公演还没结束呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1791.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"f45c17f45fc33000bee6ba3b9b9084a7ed9da2d2ba74657c35da6d0a7f1a44ad","ja":"ええ！　最後はまた、みんなで一緒に楽しみましょう。\n準備は……できていますわね？　さあ、行きますわよ！","zh":"没错！最后，让我们再一起开心地享受吧。\n准备……都做好了吧？来，我们出发！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
